@title Machine options: what the choice leaves out is ghosted, the lists name the option
@area Options
# The fixture's Cooling fan page (page 3) is only there with the Cooling fan option. With the fan off the page stays on
# the drawing, veiled and outlined, and says why on hover; View > Layers has the switch. With the fan on the page is
# normal and the device list and wire list carry an Option column.
open qa/fixtures/machine-options.novo
wait 20
expect "Options: no Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
key PageDown
wait 4
key PageDown
wait 6
shot fan-off-ghosted
check_layout
move 313 190
wait 4
shot fan-off-hover-why
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text ghost what the options leave out
wait 4
key Enter
wait 6
shot fan-off-ghost-switched-off
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text ghost what the options leave out
wait 4
key Enter
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot fan-on-normal
check_layout
click_text Reports #2
wait 20
click_text "Device list"
wait 10
expect "Option"
expect "Cooling fan"
shot device-list-option-column
check_layout
click_text "Wire list"
wait 10
expect "Option"
shot wire-list-option-column
check_layout
